{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id512335268"}, "name":{"label":"Ksmit8888"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-12T18:48:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.3"}, "id":{"label":"14420859859"}, "title":{"label":"Free trial?"}, "content":{"label":"As a person with neurodivergence, the 3day free trial is simply not enough time to know if this app will work for me. How about a month….and if it’s helpful, I’ll gladly spend $30 for the year.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id407752996"}, "name":{"label":"Hello kitty 10446"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-12T07:16:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.3"}, "id":{"label":"14418834583"}, "title":{"label":"very good app"}, "content":{"label":"this is a very good app -\ni am impressed. i downloaded like 6 different planning apps to audit before beginning university and i deleted all but this one. it’s super well rounded and easy to follow but thorough at the same time. the daily planning feature itself is very nice - easy to plan block to block and the blocks get gradually colored / filled as the time goes on in real time so you can see visually how much you have left to do x task. i absolutely love the concept of the energy monitor because one of my biggest traits is over planning and quickly becoming overwhelmed. i think that feature will be very helpful in balancing my university schedule. it also has a section for random thoughts/tasks that come to mind that you can jot down in a list to come back to later in the day. you can also add subtasks to each event you add to your schedule so if i schedule a two hour block for assignments i can add my exact assignments as subtasks and see if i get only 3/4 checked off for example in my time block then i can add the remaining in the “inbox” section for stuff to revisit / reschedule for later. all in all this is a really cool and balanced app (can’t reiterate enough how much i love the energy monitor feature) and when i begin university next month i 1000% intend to purchase lifetime so i can use it through pursuit of my J.D. :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
